    "group": "Spearhead-at-Arms",
    "summary": "When one of your models uses a Bondsman ability that no other model in your army has used this turn, it may affect as many as three of your ARMIGER models rather than one. They must be within 12\" of the user, or 15\" if your army is Honoured, and none may already be under a Bondsman ability. The effect on them lasts until your next Command phase starts.",
